                <invention-title lang="de">ANZEIGESUBSTRAT UND HERSTELLUNGSVERFAHREN DAFÜR SOWIE ANZEIGEVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SUBSTRAT D'AFFICHAGE ET SON PROCÉDÉ DE PRÉPARATION, ET APPAREIL D'AFFICHAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DISPLAY SUBSTRATE AND PREPARATION METHOD THEREFOR, AND DISPLAY APPARATUS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A display substrate and a preparation method therefor, and a display apparatus. The display substrate comprises a base (10), at least one insulating film layer, which is arranged on the base (10), and a first electrode, which is arranged on the side of the insulating film layer that is away from the base (10), wherein the side of the at least one insulating film layer that is away from the base (10) is provided with a concave-convex structure, and an orthographic projection of the concave-convex structure on the base (10) and an orthographic projection of the first electrode on the base (10) include an overlapping area.</p>
            </abstract>
